## OpsRamp

This provider can also be used to manage OpsRamp resources.

### Authentication

OpsRamp resources are configured with an `opsramp` block, authenticating against the OpsRamp API
with OAuth client credentials scoped to a tenant.  Each value may instead be supplied through the
environment.  See the [Authentication](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/HPE/hpe/latest/docs/guides/opsramp_authentication) guide for the details.

